{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は『UTB＋』の発売日です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールで撮影してきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"裏表紙です！！！\nありがたい！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/09/7942720/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンクエトワールがどんどん\nみなさんに知ってもらえたらいいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/09/7942720/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"50ページ超の乃木坂大特集号です！！\nまいやんが表紙なのが目印だよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/09/7942720/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『BOMB』の発売日です！！\n琴子、あーちゃん、ひめたん、未央奈、みり愛、中田で撮影してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えりか様、みさみさ、飛鳥、みなみが表紙なのが目印です( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、ですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『BOMB』の撮影の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10時間前"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜、寝る前にリビングで立ち眩んで倒れて\nガラスのテーブルに顔面をぶつけました(´･_･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻と口から血が出て\nしばらく鼻が痛くて\n鼻が腫れて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右ほっぺにガラスのテーブルをぶつけた跡で\nあろう線が薄く入ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/09/7942720/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直\n「あ、やばい。立ち眩みそう」\nってとこまでしか覚えてなくて\nガラスのテーブルにぶつけたのは覚えてないんだけど\nパパが証言してた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/09/7942720/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ1か月くらい前の話だし\n腫れは完全にひいてるし\n病院にも行ったし\nもうほぼ治ってるし\n今となっては笑い話なので心配しないでね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかね、鼻が腫れてる状態で握手会したけど\nみんな気づいてなかったから\n中田の気にしすぎなのかも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『BOMB』では\nよーく見たら鼻が腫れてる中田が見れますので\nチェックよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/09/7942720/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはUTB＋のオフショット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2冊ともよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}